{"root":"obrol","ipa":"/ˈobrol/","core":"指非正式的谈话、聊天、闲谈，通常指轻松、随意的交流。","pos":["动词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ˈobrol/","zh":"闲谈，聊天","phrases":[{"t":"obrol santai","zh":"轻松闲聊"},{"t":"teman mengobrol","zh":"聊天对象"},{"t":"asik mengobrol","zh":"聊得正欢"}],"examples":[{"t":"Mereka sedang asyik mengobrol di teras rumah.","zh":"他们正在屋檐下兴致勃勃地聊天。"},{"t":"Jangan terlalu lama mengobrol, kita harus segera berangkat.","zh":"别聊太久了，我们得马上出发。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"obrol","ipa":"/ˈobrol/","zh":"闲谈（原型词）","phrase":{"t":"obrol kosong","zh":"闲扯，废话"},"example":{"t":"Hanya obrol biasa saja.","zh":"只是普通的闲聊而已。"}},{"w":"mengobrol","ipa":"/məˈŋobrol/","zh":"进行闲谈，聊天","phrase":{"t":"mengobrol panjang lebar","zh":"滔滔不绝地聊天"},"example":{"t":"Kami mengobrol tentang rencana liburan.","zh":"我们聊了关于度假的计划。"}},{"w":"obrolan","ipa":"/obroˈlan/","zh":"谈话内容，聊天记录","phrase":{"t":"isi obrolan","zh":"谈话内容"},"example":{"t":"Obrolan mereka sangat menarik.","zh":"他们的谈话内容非常有趣。"}},{"w":"pengobrol","ipa":"/pəŋoˈbrol/","zh":"爱聊天的人，健谈者","phrase":{"t":"pengobrol ulung","zh":"健谈高手"},"example":{"t":"Dia adalah seorang pengobrol yang menyenangkan.","zh":"他是一个令人愉快的健谈者。"}}],"derSlugs":["obrol","mengobrol","obrolan","pengobrol"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-28T02:32:17.391Z","src":"base"}